      "side": 0,
      "message": "Note to self:\nI needed to remove this line because genrules called `VisitDirectDepsBlueprint`, which allowed through disabled modules, and then called `PrebuiltGetPreferred`, which replaced a disabled source module with an enabled prebuilt.  It does that because it adds the tools dependencies late, after the prebuilts mutator has run, so it doesn\u0027t get the automatic rewriting.\n\nRemoving this line causes failures in aosp-build-tools linux_musl builds with AllowMissingDependencies set, because returning nil was preventing a module from retrieving an unset OptionalPath from a disabled dependency.\n\nMoving the tools dep earlier might help, but it was moved late to avoid accidentally following variant creation, and moving it earlier is causing some unexpected build.ninja changes that need more investigation.",
